    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewAspect": "join",
      "reviewBody": "The authors created a historical food‑security measure by matching each HPS respondent to two CPS‑FSS respondents using propensity‑score matching on a set of common demographic variables. The matched CPS records were then merged with the HPS file to provide a pre‑pandemic food‑security baseline.",
      "citation": {
