        "methodology": "The authors constructed a pre‑pandemic food security baseline by linking each Household Pulse Survey respondent to two individuals from the 2018 Current Population Survey Food Security Supplement. Because no unique identifiers exist across the two surveys, they used propensity score matching on a se"
      },
      "reviewRating": [
