    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewAspect": "join",
      "reviewBody": "During weighting of the HPS, the authors applied an adjustment that aligns the survey weights to occupied housing‑unit counts derived from the ACS. This requires merging the ACS housing‑unit estimates with the HPS weighting process.",
      "citation": {
