        "methodology": "The authors first extracted the occupied housing‑unit counts from the 2014‑2018 5‑year American Community Survey (ACS) at the finest geographic level available (state‑FIPS, county‑FIPS, and census‑tract). The Household Pulse Survey (HPS) records also contain the same geographic identifiers for each "
      },
